<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;"><span style="font-size:medium; text-align:start"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="font-variant-ligatures:normal"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="white-space:normal"><span style="text-decoration-thickness:initial"><span style="text-decoration-style:initial"><span style="text-decoration-color:initial"><span style="display:inline !important"><span style="float:none">Dear&nbsp;{{{Recipient.FirstName}}},</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><br style="color:#000000; font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size:medium; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-weight:400; text-align:start; white-space:normal; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial" />
<br style="color:#000000; font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size:medium; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-weight:400; text-align:start; white-space:normal; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial" />
<font face="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><font style="color:#000000; font-size:medium; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-weight:400; text-align:start; white-space:normal; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial"><span style="font-size:14.6667px">We wanted to proactively share that we are currently experiencing some delays in receiving certain materials from our suppliers, which could potentially impact upcoming production schedules.<br />
<br />
At this time, your order remains on track, and we are doing everything we can to maintain the quoted lead times. That said, we believe in open communication and wanted to keep you informed in case this situation changes.</span></font></font><br style="color:#000000; font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size:medium; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-weight:400; text-align:start; white-space:normal; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial" />
<br style="color:#000000; font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size:medium; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-weight:400; text-align:start; white-space:normal; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial" />
<span style="font-size:medium; text-align:start"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="font-variant-ligatures:normal"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="white-space:normal"><span style="text-decoration-thickness:initial"><span style="text-decoration-style:initial"><span style="text-decoration-color:initial"><span style="display:inline !important"><span style="float:none">Our team is actively working with our supplier network and exploring alternative solutions to minimize any potential impact.&nbsp; We're monitoring the situation closely and will keep you updated should anything affect your order.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><br style="color:#000000; font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size:medium; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-weight:400; text-align:start; white-space:normal; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial" />
<br style="color:#000000; font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size:medium; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-weight:400; text-align:start; white-space:normal; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial" />
<span style="font-size:medium; text-align:start"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="font-variant-ligatures:normal"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="white-space:normal"><span style="text-decoration-thickness:initial"><span style="text-decoration-style:initial"><span style="text-decoration-color:initial"><span style="display:inline !important"><span style="float:none">Thank you for your understanding and continued partnership-- we truly appreciate it!</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><br style="color:#000000; font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size:medium; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-weight:400; text-align:start; white-space:normal; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial" />
